OL,3,GNEWSATeen tree surgeon's death
OL,4,Aaccidental, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of an apprentice tree surgeon
OL,7,Fwho was crushed by a tree he was
OL,8,Ffelling was accidental, an inquest has
OL,9,Fruled.
OL,11,FJonty Parkinson was working in woodland
OL,12,Fon a National Trust site near
OL,13,FFaringdon, Oxfordshire, on 6 September
OL,14,F2024 when he was crushed by a tree that
OL,15,Fdid not fall in the intended way.
OL,17,FJurors at Oxford Coroner's Court ruled
OL,18,Fon Thursday that Parkinson's death had
OL,19,Fbeen accidental.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
